蓝调的色彩，要很庞克地唱给你2007年最酷的一件事就是--吃早餐!","released_formatted":"16 Mar 2007","identifiers":[],"videos":[],"genres":["Pop"],"styles":["Indie Pop"],"tracklist":[{"position":"1","type_":"track","title":"早安，晨之美","duration":""},{"position":"2","type_":"track","title":"Boring","duration":""},{"position":"3","type_":"track","title":"卡拉，晨之美！","duration":""}],"images":[{"type":"secondary","uri":"https://i.discogs.com/1zlUN-QWA-t66rXUVn6XNkgbIxD6vi--0jeu_vA8LGg/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:467/w:540/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9SLTMzMjk0/MTk4LTE3NDA5MzM5/NTQtODIzNS5qcGVn.jpeg","resource_url":"https://i.discogs.com/1zlUN-QWA-t66rXUVn6XNkgbIxD6vi--0jeu_vA8LGg/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:467/w:540/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9SLTMzMjk0/MTk4LTE3NDA5MzM5/NTQtODIzNS5qcGVn.jpeg","uri150":"https://i.discogs.com/jk_FMeqIYozylCpy5UHyOhe-U7dg1MT-wTRlXtgC-Ww/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9SLTMzMjk0/MTk4LTE3NDA5MzM5/NTQtODIzNS5qcGVn.jpeg","width":540,"height":467}],"thumb":"https://i.discogs.com/jk_FMeqIYozylCpy5UHyOhe-U7dg1MT-wTRlXtgC-Ww/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9SLTMzMjk0/MTk4LTE3NDA5MzM5/NTQtODIzNS5qcGVn.jpeg","estimated_weight":85,"blocked_from_sale":false,"is_offensive":false}